{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Merge Maestro is a rogue-like merge-builder (the first of it's kind?) Merge Emoji themed Tokens together to create more powerful Tokens to defeat waves of enemies. Craft your set with<strong>\u00a0Hundreds</strong> of unique Tokens to create<strong>\u00a0Thousands</strong> of powerful and wacky combinations. No two runs will ever be the same in this bite sized arcade-like, puzzle-like roguelike!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Gameplay</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Place </strong>Tokens on  on the board and\u00a0<strong>Merge</strong>\u00a0tokens of the same type to make ones of a higher Level. Higher Level Tokens are Stronger!!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519530/extras/1-c.gif?t=1749560292\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Choose</strong>\u00a0a new Token to add to your set at the end of every wave. There are 100's of Tokens to discover each with unique effects!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519530/extras/2-c.gif?t=1749560292\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Synergize</strong> your build to defeat the ever more challenging enemies that come each wave across multiple difficulties and challenges!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519530/extras/3-c.gif?t=1749560292\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Gain</strong>\u00a0crazy Powers throughout each run, each with game changing, potentially even game breaking effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519530/extras/Abilities3.gif?t=1749560292\" /></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">300+ Unique Emoji based Tokens to be discovered with their own special effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">50+ Game-changing Powers to experiment with, each completely changing the mechanics of a run</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">10 themed packs of Tokens that get more complex and wacky</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">6 Difficulty modes that progressively force you to learn and adapt to ever more cunning enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">20 Challenges that completely change the way the game is played</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Endless Strategies</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Construct a city to whittle down your enemies turn by turn</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Become a chef and combine foods, fruit and drinks to turn your tokens super!</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Destroy your own tokens and create a relentless resurrecting army of the dead</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And<strong> much, much</strong> <u><strong>more</strong></u>!!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519530/extras/Together1.gif?t=1749560292\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Join The Community!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519530/extras/Discord_Capsule.png?t=1749560292\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Join the Discord channel for announcements and to give any feedback, suggestions or post any bugs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3519530?t=1749560292","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3519530?t=1749560292","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/s